
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6826888565?mt=12">GroovSide</a> is a silly little app that puts a record player on your desktop and “spins” the record for your current song. Maybe I’m showing my age but it utterly delights me.</p>



